{"data":{"product":{"id":"gid://shopify/Product/7536988520545","title":"Polka Dot Mommy and Me Dresses - Puff Sleeve Sundress","handle":"polka-dot-mommy-and-me-dresses","status":"ACTIVE","publishedAt":"2026-04-24T14:24:58Z","onlineStoreUrl":"https://www.dresslikemommy.com/products/polka-dot-mommy-and-me-dresses","descriptionHtml":"<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven polyester with a soft drape that feels airy, floaty, and photo-ready on warm days.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A picture-perfect matching dress moment for mom and daughter, made for garden parties, picnic photos, birthdays, and vacation afternoons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> \"Polka Dot\" comes in Pink or White, both finished with bold black polka dots for a playful summer look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Puff short sleeves, statement ruffle trim, gently gathered waist, and a twirl-friendly midi skirt that moves beautifully with every step.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, line dry, do not bleach, and use a cool iron inside-out if needed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Girls Child 4 Years to Child 12 Years; Mother S to Mother XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Dress</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Skirt Length (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>16-19 kg / 35-42 lbs</td>\n<td>110 cm / 43.3 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>19-22 kg / 42-49 lbs</td>\n<td>120 cm / 47.2 in</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>22-27 kg / 49-60 lbs</td>\n<td>130 cm / 51.2 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>81 cm / 31.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>81 cm / 31.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>27-32 kg / 60-71 lbs</td>\n<td>140 cm / 55.1 in</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>87 cm / 34.3 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>87 cm / 34.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>32-38 kg / 71-84 lbs</td>\n<td>150 cm / 59.1 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>93 cm / 36.6 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>93 cm / 36.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 12 Years</td>\n<td>11-12</td>\n<td>38-46 kg / 84-101 lbs</td>\n<td>160 cm / 63.0 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n<td>99 cm / 39.0 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n<td>99 cm / 39.0 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>45-52.5 kg / 99-116 lbs</td>\n<td>165 cm / 65.0 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>107 cm / 42.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n<td>107 cm / 42.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>52.5-60 kg / 116-132 lbs</td>\n<td>170 cm / 66.9 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>109 cm / 42.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0 in</td>\n<td>109 cm / 42.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>60-67.5 kg / 132-149 lbs</td>\n<td>175 cm / 68.9 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>111 cm / 43.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7 in</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n<td>111 cm / 43.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>67.5-75 kg / 149-165 lbs</td>\n<td>180 cm / 70.9 in</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n<td>113 cm / 44.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>110 cm / 43.3 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>113 cm / 44.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Polka Dot Mommy and Me Dresses bring a playful picnic-ready feel to matching family style. The airy dotted fabric brightens the silhouette, while the square neckline, puff sleeves, and ruffle trim give mom and mini a polished sunny-day look.</p>\n\n<p>From park strolls to vacation dinners, the puff sleeves and gathered skirt keep the dress looking dressed up while still feeling light and easy to wear. The side-tie waist and twirl-friendly shape make it an easy pick for portraits, birthdays, and every sunny plan in between.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Two color options:</strong> Choose Pink or White, each with bold black dots for a playful, classic finish.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ruffle-trim neckline:</strong> Soft front ruffles and a square neckline add a sweet dress-up finish for mom and mini.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Puff short sleeves:</strong> Gentle volume at the shoulder keeps the silhouette sweet and summer friendly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy gathered skirt:</strong> The relaxed midi shape moves beautifully for parties, vacations, and portraits.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom and mini matching:</strong> Coordinated mother-and-daughter styling makes family dressing feel effortless.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose your sizes and bring home a matching polka-dot sundress set that feels ready for every warm-weather memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Black","Child 11-12yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Dots","Dresses","Girl Dress","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1041018954140.html","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Dresses","Midi Dress","Midi Dresses","Mom Size L","Mom Size M","Mom Size S","Mom Size XL","Mommy and Me","Mother Dress","Picnic","Pink","Polka Dot","Puff Sleeve Dress","Resort","Ruffle Trim","Summer","Sundress","Sundresses","Vacation","White"],"seo":{